<title>USA: Commercial Federal to buy Kansas bank.</title>
<headline>Commercial Federal to buy Kansas bank.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial Federal Corp said it entered into a definitive agreement to acquire all 232,465 outstanding shares of  Investors Federal Savings for $23 per share in cash.</p>
<p>Investors Federal operates three banks in southwest Kansas.</p>
<p>Closing is expected in the second quarter of 1997, the bank holding company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
